<title>UK: Euroclear to settle Greek domestic debt.</title>
<headline>Euroclear to settle Greek domestic debt.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Euroclear services will be offered for Greek domestic debt securities, starting on the August 4 settlement date, Euroclear said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Citibank NA Athens has been appointed as the local Euroclear depositary for Greek debt securities and the local Euroclear cash correspondent for the Greek Drachma from August 4.</p>
<p>Euroclear said it now offered a single point of entry for settlement and custody services for all European debt securities.</p>
<p>--Denise Manning, London newsroom,  +44 171 542 7658</p>
